<title>JAPAN: Toshiba says chip recovery unlikely next year.</title>
<headline>Toshiba says chip recovery unlikely next year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toshiba Corp said on Friday that the semiconductor chip market was unlikely to recover before the end of 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;As we expect expansion in production capacity by semiconductor makers, including Taiwanese makers, to continue next year, profit recovery in the chip industry is unlikely next year,&quot; Toshiba Vice President Atsumi Uchiyama told as news conference.</p>
</text>
